    "description": "<p>The Sidereal can use this Charm when a person is suffering from some normal disease--i.e., not a Charm's Sickness effect or the effects of an infectious martial art (from Scroll of the Monk, pp. 153�154). The Sidereal makes the Inferior Sign of the Corpse over the sick person, targeting the least god of that person's illness. The Sidereal's player rolls (Intelligence + Medicine + Essence) against the disease's listed Difficulty to Treat. If the roll succeeds, the illness's least god relinquishes its hold on the victim, and the victim begins to recover.</p>",
